   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks Ben - <div><br></div><div>This solution is really neat--makes it much easier to explicitly model time variation in the `Bvec`. </div><div><br></div><div>Jim</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Saturday, February 6, 2016 at 8:40:17 AM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Saturday, February 6, 2016 at 8:00:31 AM UTC-5, James Savage wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Ideally, I&#39;d want to do something like<div><br></div><div>parameters{</div><div>matrix[3, 3] B;</div><div>B[1,2] &lt;- 0;</div><div>B[1,3] &lt;- 0;</div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>Instead I&#39;m doing something like</div><div><br></div><div><div>transformed parameters {</div><div>  matrix[3,3] B1;</div><div>  for(i in 1:3){</div><div>    for(j in 1:3){</div><div>    if(i==1 &amp;&amp; j==2){</div><div>      B1[i,j] &lt;- 0;</div><div>    }</div><div>    if(i==1 &amp;&amp; j ==3){</div><div>      B1[i,j] &lt;- 0;</div><div>    }</div><div>    else {</div><div>      B1[i,j] &lt;- B[i,j];</div><div>    }</div><div>  }}</div><div>}</div></div><div><br></div><div>In which case I&#39;m declaring parameters (in B) that don&#39;t get used in the model. Is this going to be a problem? </div></div></blockquote><div><br>I would declare a parameter vector and transform it into a matrix<span style=\"color:#000\"></span> using the new slicing assignment syntax:<br><span style=\"color:#000\"></span><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">transformed data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">// you could also pass these in as data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">upper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameters </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Bvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">row_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">col_mark</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Bvec</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>Ben<br><br></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
